desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "python"
	title: "数据流：Python OS Command Injection: User Input in Shell Command"
	title_zh: "数据流：Python OS 命令注入：用户输入进入 Shell 命令"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "ssa-python-command-injection"
	risk: "command-injection"
	cwe: "CWE-78"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 漏洞描述
请求参数拼接进 `os.system`、`os.popen` 的 shell 命令文本。攻击者可追加 `;`、`|`、`$()` 执行任意命令。

### 检测方式
跟踪 Flask/Django 请求参数到 `os.system`、`os.popen` 的实参。使用参数列表的 `subprocess` 调用不在本规则范围。

### 风险类型
command-injection
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
避免 shell 解释器，改用参数列表：

```python
subprocess.run(["ping", "-c", "1", host], check=False)
```

必须使用 shell 时，用 `shlex.quote()` 转义每个参数，并对输入做白名单校验。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-78: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an OS Command](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html)
REFERENCE
	alert_min: 1
)

request.args.get(* as $src)
request.form.get(* as $src)
request.values.get(* as $src)
request.GET.get(* as $src)
request.POST.get(* as $src)

os.system(* as $arg)
os.popen(* as $arg)
$arg?{<self> #{include: <<<CODE
* & $src as $__next__
CODE
}->} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Python OS Command Injection: User Input in Shell Command",
	title_zh: "Python OS 命令注入：用户输入进入 Shell 命令",
	risk: "command-injection",
}

desc(
	lang: python
	alert_high: 1
	'file://unsafe_command.py': <<<UNSAFE
import os
from flask import request

def ping():
    host = request.args.get("host", "")
    os.system("ping -c 1 " + host)
UNSAFE
	'safefile://safe_command.py': <<<SAFE
def run() -> str:
    return "ok"
SAFE
)
